  * Report the failing stage in the tuning daemon eBPF observer warning
    (kprobe attach vs program load) to make deployment diagnostics
    unambiguous.

 -- Curtsy contributors <maintainers@example.invalid>  Wed, 29 Jul 2026 17:25:10 +0000

curtsy (0.2.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix tuning daemon eBPF observer never loading: correct an off-by-one
    jump offset that made the verifier reject the kprobe programs, and
    attach the kprobe PMU events per online CPU (perf_event_open rejects
    pid == -1 with cpu == -1).

 -- Curtsy contributors <maintainers@example.invalid>  Wed, 29 Jul 2026 17:15:30 +0000

curtsy (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add UDP sockmap acceleration: established UDP associations are steered
    in the kernel via a verdict-only SK_SKB program, controlled by the new
    performance.udpSockmapAcceleration option (default auto).

